<title>USA: Ogden sees Q3 earnings below expectations.</title>
<headline>Ogden sees Q3 earnings below expectations.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ogden Corp said Friday it expects third quarters earnings to fall short of expectations due to a weaker-than-anticipated performance by its technology unit, Atlantic Design.</p>
<p>Ogden said that while its core units &quot;continue to show meaningful earnings growth versus last year,&quot; they could not compensate for Atlantic Design's earnings shortfall.  </p>
<p>Ogden said it expects to complete the proposed sale of the Atlantic Design unit by next spring.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
